    {"id":"killer_two_cell_sums_ex1","title":{"en":"Example 1: Two-Cell Sums","ko":"실전 예시 1: 두 칸 묶음의 합","ja":"実践例 1: 2マスのケージの合計","zh-CN":"实战范例 1: 两格笼子的总和","zh-TW":"實戰範例 1: 兩格籠子的總和","es-ES":"Ejemplo práctico 1: Sumas de dos casillas","de":"Praxisbeispiel 1: Summen aus zwei Feldern","fr":"Exemple pratique 1 : Sommes de deux cases","pt":"Exemplo prático 1: Somas de duas casas","it":"Esempio pratico 1: Somme di due caselle","ru":"Практический пример 1: Суммы двух клеток","hi":"व्यावहारिक उदाहरण 1: दो सेल का जोड़","ar":"مثال عملي 1: مجموع خليتين"},"guide":{"en":"The cage marked 10 has two cells with different digits that add up to 10. So it can never use half of 10: that would need the same digit twice. Which candidate goes from the target cell r4c1?","ko":"합 10짜리 두 칸 묶음에는 더해서 10이 되는 서로 다른 두 숫자가 들어갑니다. 그래서 10의 절반은 쓸 수 없습니다. 같은 숫자가 두 번 필요하기 때문입니다. 목표 칸 r4c1에서 지워지는 후보는 무엇일까요?","ja":"「10」の2マスのケージには、足して10になる異なる2つの数字が入ります。だから10の半分は使えません。同じ数字が2つ必要になるからです。目標マス r4c1 から消える候補はどれでしょう？","zh-CN":"标着 10 的两格笼子里是相加为 10 的两个不同数字，所以不能用 10 的一半：那需要同一个数字两次。目标格 r4c1 中会被删去的候选数是哪个？","zh-TW":"標著 10 的兩格籠子裡是相加為 10 的兩個不同數字，所以不能用 10 的一半：那需要同一個數字兩次。目標格 r4c1 中會被刪去的候選數是哪個？","es-ES":"La jaula marcada con 10 tiene dos casillas con cifras distintas que suman 10, así que nunca puede usar la mitad de 10: haría falta la misma cifra dos veces. ¿Qué candidato sale de la casilla objetivo r4c1?","de":"Der Käfig mit der 10 hat zwei Felder mit verschiedenen Ziffern, die zusammen 10 ergeben. Die Hälfte von 10 geht also nie, dafür bräuchte es dieselbe Ziffer zweimal. Welcher Kandidat fällt im Zielfeld r4c1 weg?","fr":"La cage marquée 10 a deux cases aux chiffres différents dont la somme fait 10. Elle ne peut donc jamais utiliser la moitié de 10 : il faudrait deux fois le même chiffre. Quel candidat quitte la case cible r4c1 ?","pt":"A gaiola marcada com 10 tem duas casas com números diferentes que somam 10, então nunca pode usar a metade de 10: seria preciso o mesmo número duas vezes. Qual candidato sai da casa alvo r4c1?","it":"La gabbia con il 10 ha due caselle con cifre diverse che sommano 10, quindi non può mai usare la metà di 10: servirebbe due volte la stessa cifra. Quale candidato esce dalla casella obiettivo r4c1?","ru":"В области с числом 10 две клетки с разными цифрами, которые в сумме дают 10. Поэтому половина 10 невозможна: понадобилась бы одна цифра дважды. Какой кандидат уходит из целевой клетки r4c1?","hi":"10 लिखे दो सेल के समूह में दो अलग अंक हैं जिनका जोड़ 10 है, इसलिए 10 का आधा कभी नहीं आ सकता: उसके लिए वही अंक दो बार चाहिए। लक्ष्य सेल r4c1 से कौन-सा उम्मीदवार हटता है?","ar":"القفص المكتوب عليه 10 من خليتين فيهما رقمان مختلفان مجموعهما 10، فلا يمكن أبدًا استعمال نصف 10: سيحتاج الرقم نفسه مرتين. أي مرشح يُحذف من الخلية الهدف r4c1؟"},"layoutType":"grid9x9","asks":"eliminated","targetIndex":27,"correctVal":5,"cages":[{"cells":[0,1,9,18],"sum":18},{"cells":[2,11],"sum":16},{"cells":[3,12,13],"sum":18},{"cells":[4,5,14],"sum":7},{"cells":[6,7],"sum":8},{"cells":[8,17,26],"sum":14},{"cells":[10,19],"sum":7},{"cells":[15,16,25,34],"sum":25},{"cells":[20,29],"sum":12},{"cells":[21,22,30],"sum":15},{"cells":[23,24],"sum":16},{"cells":[27,28],"sum":10},{"cells":[31,40,49,50],"sum":21},{"cells":[32,33],"sum":7},{"cells":[35,44],"sum":12},{"cells":[36,45,46,54],"sum":22},{"cells":[37,38,39],"sum":7},{"cells":[41,42,43],"sum":16},{"cells":[47,48,57],"sum":15},{"cells":[51,59,60],"sum":16},{"cells":[52,61],"sum":10},{"cells":[53,62],"sum":10},{"cells":[55,64,73],"sum":16},{"cells":[56,65,66],"sum":10},{"cells":[58,67,68,69],"sum":17},{"cells":[63,72],"sum":13},{"cells":[70,71,80],"sum":16},{"cells":[74,75],"sum":15},{"cells":[76,77],"sum":13},{"cells":[78,79],"sum":3}],"cells":[{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{"notes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],"style":{"background":"rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.16)"}},{"notes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],"style":{"background":"rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.16)"}},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{}],"eliminations":[[27,[5]],[28,[5]]]},
    {"id":"killer_two_cell_sums_ex2","title":{"en":"Example 2: Two-Cell Sums","ko":"실전 예시 2: 두 칸 묶음의 합","ja":"実践例 2: 2マスのケージの合計","zh-CN":"实战范例 2: 两格笼子的总和","zh-TW":"實戰範例 2: 兩格籠子的總和","es-ES":"Ejemplo práctico 2: Sumas de dos casillas","de":"Praxisbeispiel 2: Summen aus zwei Feldern","fr":"Exemple pratique 2 : Sommes de deux cases","pt":"Exemplo prático 2: Somas de duas casas","it":"Esempio pratico 2: Somme di due caselle","ru":"Практический пример 2: Суммы двух клеток","hi":"व्यावहारिक उदाहरण 2: दो सेल का जोड़","ar":"مثال عملي 2: مجموع خليتين"},"guide":{"en":"In the two-cell cage marked 9, the other cell is at least 1, so no digit bigger than 8 fits. Which candidate goes from the target cell r3c1?","ko":"합 9짜리 두 칸 묶음에서 다른 칸은 아무리 작아도 1입니다. 그래서 8보다 큰 숫자는 들어갈 수 없습니다. 목표 칸 r3c1에서 지워지는 후보는 무엇일까요?","ja":"「9」の2マスのケージでは、もう1マスはどんなに小さくても1です。だから8より大きい数字は入りません。目標マス r3c1 から消える候補はどれでしょう？","zh-CN":"标着 9 的两格笼子里，另一格最小也是 1，所以大于 8 的数字放不进去。目标格 r3c1 中会被删去的候选数是哪个？","zh-TW":"標著 9 的兩格籠子裡，另一格最小也是 1，所以大於 8 的數字放不進去。目標格 r3c1 中會被刪去的候選數是哪個？","es-ES":"En la jaula de dos casillas marcada con 9, la otra casilla vale como mínimo 1, así que no cabe ninguna cifra mayor que 8. ¿Qué candidato sale de la casilla objetivo r3c1?","de":"Im Käfig mit der 9 aus zwei Feldern ist das andere Feld mindestens 1, also passt keine Ziffer größer als 8. Welcher Kandidat fällt im Zielfeld r3c1 weg?","fr":"Dans la cage de deux cases marquée 9, l’autre case vaut au moins 1 : aucun chiffre supérieur à 8 n’y entre. Quel candidat quitte la case cible r3c1 ?","pt":"Na gaiola de duas casas marcada com 9, a outra casa vale no mínimo 1, então nenhum número maior que 8 cabe. Qual candidato sai da casa alvo r3c1?","it":"Nella gabbia di due caselle con il 9, l’altra casella vale almeno 1, quindi nessuna cifra maggiore di 8 ci sta. Quale candidato esce dalla casella obiettivo r3c1?","ru":"В области из двух клеток с числом 9 другая клетка не меньше 1, поэтому цифра больше 8 не подходит. Какой кандидат уходит из целевой клетки r3c1?","hi":"9 लिखे दो सेल के समूह में दूसरा सेल कम से कम 1 है, इसलिए 8 से बड़ा कोई अंक नहीं आ सकता। लक्ष्य सेल r3c1 से कौन-सा उम्मीदवार हटता है?","ar":"في القفص المكتوب عليه 9 من خليتين، الخلية الأخرى 1 على الأقل، فلا يدخل أي رقم أكبر من 8. أي مرشح يُحذف من الخلية الهدف r3c1؟"},"layoutType":"grid9x9","asks":"eliminated","targetIndex":18,"correctVal":9,"cages":[{"cells":[0,1,9],"sum":20},{"cells":[2,10,11],"sum":12},{"cells":[3,12,21],"sum":15},{"cells":[4,5],"sum":12},{"cells":[6,14,15],"sum":14},{"cells":[7,16],"sum":12},{"cells":[8,17,25,26],"sum":17},{"cells":[13,22,23,24],"sum":20},{"cells":[18,27],"sum":9},{"cells":[19,20],"sum":5},{"cells":[28,29,30],"sum":16},{"cells":[31,32,41,50],"sum":23},{"cells":[33,34,43],"sum":14},{"cells":[35,44],"sum":14},{"cells":[36,37,38],"sum":15},{"cells":[39,40],"sum":13},{"cells":[42,51],"sum":9},{"cells":[45,46],"sum":7},{"cells":[47,48],"sum":14},{"cells":[49,58,67],"sum":9},{"cells":[52,61],"sum":8},{"cells":[53,62],"sum":3},{"cells":[54,63,72],"sum":15},{"cells":[55,56,57],"sum":21},{"cells":[59,60,68],"sum":8},{"cells":[64,73,74],"sum":11},{"cells":[65,66,75],"sum":16},{"cells":[69,70],"sum":15},{"cells":[71,79,80],"sum":17},{"cells":[76,77,78],"sum":21}],"cells":[{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{"notes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],"style":{"background":"rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.16)"}},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{"notes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],"style":{"background":"rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.16)"}},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{}],"eliminations":[[18,[9]],[27,[9]]]}
